{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1752624000, "end_date": 1753315199, "month_true_total": 88, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:53 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "200469138", "author": {"steamid": "76561199799901128", "personaname": "froscat", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199799901128/", "num_games_owned": 65, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 638, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 567, "last_played": 1755199741, "avatar": "55bd911c2dcbfe69a0ffd42606e285b8f9e83694"}, "language": "english", "review": "as a game, it's alright but defiantly doesn't feel as good as the other Mass Effect games and my main complaints are just the actual combat is much more restricting and the multiplayer is bad but I'd still maybe like it if it weren't for the fact that it just does what every other mass effect did but worse", "timestamp_created": 1753310778, "timestamp_updated": 1753310778, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200465776", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990921846", "personaname": "SlyHunter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197990921846/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3600, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 277, "last_played": 1757479629, "avatar": "15335652c71c600d3ab94dca2403b9a0310d7b25"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love the story.", "timestamp_created": 1753306503, "timestamp_updated": 1753306503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200396692", "author": {"steamid": "76561198200830306", "personaname": "Alicaso", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198200830306/", "num_games_owned": 539, "num_reviews": 117, "playtime_forever": 2017, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2017, "last_played": 1673238406, "avatar": "e71e68f22eeb4e64b73038d530f507d1ea0f126f"}, "language": "english", "review": "does not have the writing or the soul of its predacessor.", "timestamp_created": 1753218368, "timestamp_updated": 1753218368, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.526111304759979248", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200387306", "author": {"steamid": "76561198113218796", "personaname": "matthew.joyner", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198113218796/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 15075, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10953, "last_played": 1753641339, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The gameplay in Mass Effect: Andromeda leaves something to be desired. Controls and interface design can feel clunky, exploration is sometimes frustrating, and the base mechanics aren’t always polished—especially compared to earlier Mass Effect titles.\r\n\r\nHowever, with the help of the Frosty Mod Manager and some key mods, the game becomes significantly more playable and enjoyable. Mods like Road Rage (improving Nomad handling), Jetpack for All Profiles, Better Loot, and 999 Power Cells help smooth out the rough edges and let you focus more on the experience rather than fighting the UI or mechanics.\r\n\r\nWhat really shines is the story and worldbuilding. Despite its flaws, Andromeda offers an engaging narrative with intriguing characters, deep lore, and the classic Mass Effect tension between exploration, survival, and moral choice. It doesn’t reach the heights of the original trilogy, but for fans of space RPGs, there’s a lot to like—especially if you mod it just right.\r\n\r\nVerdict: With mods, it’s worth your time—especially if you're in it for the story.", "timestamp_created": 1753208719, "timestamp_updated": 1753208719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "200376266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198054965088", "personaname": "Deli🔻", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198054965088/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 965, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 147, "last_played": 1753378079, "avatar": "ffc06397744cc94e908766d13978e684f122bcb8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I cant run the game without a mod manager so it is automatic not recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1753197982, "timestamp_updated": 1753197982, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52520376443862915", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}